{"id":1177,"date":"2025-08-21T21:20:14","date_gmt":"2025-08-21T19:20:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ruta-de-las-cuevas-kayak-doble\/"},"modified":"2025-12-03T20:55:06","modified_gmt":"2025-12-03T19:55:06","slug":"ruta-de-las-cuevas-kayak-doble","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/ruta-de-las-cuevas-kayak-doble\/","title":{"rendered":"Ruta de les Coves Caiac Doble"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1177\" class=\"elementor elementor-1177 elementor-661\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c332b79 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c332b79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2087386 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2087386\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82fa3ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82fa3ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Excursi\u00f3 en caiac doble Ruta de coves - Cala'n Porter<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a035f39 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a035f39\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article id=\"kayak-doble-ruta-cuevas\" class=\"vm-excursion-card\"><header class=\"vm-excursion-header\">\n<p class=\"vm-excursion-intro\">Una sortida en parella o en fam\u00edlia per la costa amb m\u00e9s coves marines de l&#8217;illa.<\/p>\n<p class=\"vm-excursion-operator\"><strong>Operador:<\/strong> excursi\u00f3 realitzada per un soci col\u00b7laborador de Voyager Menorca.<\/p>\n\n<\/header><section class=\"vm-excursion-description\">Remarem al costat de penya-segats de calc\u00e0ria i entrarem \u2014quan el mar ho permet\u2014 en cavitats d&#8217;aig\u00fces turquesa. Una experi\u00e8ncia f\u00e0cil, fotog\u00e8nica i perfecta per a aquells que volen iniciar-se en el caiac. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Qu\u00e8 veur\u00e0s<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Trams de costa verge amb penya-segats alts i cales resguardades.<\/li>\n \t<li>Coves marines i arcs naturals; segons condicions, petita parada per a snorkel en una cala tranquil\u00b7la (zona de Cales Coves).<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Format \u201cdoble\u201d<\/strong>: ideal per a 2 + 1.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Caiac autobuidable doble<\/strong> (molt estable i c\u00f2mode).<\/li>\n \t<li>Possibilitat de tercera pla\u00e7a infantil (nens petits com a 3r ocupant; subjecta a disponibilitat).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Durada i horaris<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Durada:<\/strong> 3 hores d&#8217;activitat.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Sortides:<\/strong> mat\u00ed i tarda; assignem el millor horari segons vent i disponibilitat (refer\u00e8ncies habituals: 09:00, 10:15, 12:00, 16:00, 16:30).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Punt de trobada<\/h3>\n<strong>Cala en Porter<\/strong> o <strong>Es Canutells<\/strong> (zona sud). Confirmem l&#8217;embarcador en reservar per escollir el tram m\u00e9s protegit aquell dia. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Inclou<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Caiac doble autobuidable, armilla, pales i bid\u00f3 estanc.<\/li>\n \t<li>Guia durant tota la ruta.<\/li>\n \t<li>Reportatge de fotos amb c\u00e0mera d&#8217;acci\u00f3 de cortesia.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Qu\u00e8 portar<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Banyador i samarreta per al sol, gorra i crema solar.<\/li>\n \t<li>Aigua i un snack, tovallola i escarpins.<\/li>\n \t<li>M\u00e0scara de snorkel (recomanable). Subjecta les ulleres graduades\/sol si les fas servir. <\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Nivell i requisits<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Dificultat:<\/strong> baixa (t\u00e8cnica) | <strong>Esfor\u00e7:<\/strong> mitj\u00e0.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Imprescindible<\/strong> saber nedar.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Edat:<\/strong> menors acompanyats d&#8217;un adult; a partir de 14 anys poden remar a la seva pla\u00e7a.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Idioma principal del guia:<\/strong> espanyol (suport en angl\u00e8s segons monitor).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Pol\u00edtica ambiental<\/h3>\nRespectem les normes de <strong>Red Natura 2000<\/strong>: algunes coves sensibles no es visiten per protegir fauna i h\u00e0bitats. La seguretat i la conservaci\u00f3 manen. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n <h3>Avisos importants<\/h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Activitat subjecta a l&#8217;estat del mar i del vent. L&#8217;itinerari pot variar per seguretat. <\/li>\n      <li>Places limitades. Material i places infantils subjectes a disponibilitat. <\/li>\n      <li>L&#8217;operaci\u00f3, assegurances i facturaci\u00f3 corresponen al soci col\u00b7laborador.<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/section>\n<\/article>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df93b40 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"df93b40\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f91aa69 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f91aa69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ruta-cueva